            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan <code>print(\"Hi there!\")</code> ke blok kode perulangan while dengan menempatkannya di antara <code>{</code> dan <code>}</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi there!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>while true {</code>, diikuti oleh <code>print(\"Hi there!\")</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
